{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 1320,
    "dDurationMs": 2660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Some critics of the TV show Mythbusters claim"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3980,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that the show misrepresents the scientific process."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6880,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For example, experiments are sometimes conducted only once"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 10140,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and without adequate controls,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 12220,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but then these results are"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 13940,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "generalized to make definitive claims"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 15940,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "rather than repeating the experiment"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 17820,
    "dDurationMs": 2620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and using statistical analysis as a scientist would"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 20440,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to figure out what is really true."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 23040,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, ironically a show"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 24400,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that is meant to educate people about science"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 26600,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "may instead be giving them the opposite impression"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 29140,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of how science works."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 31020,
    "dDurationMs": 3740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But you know, similar criticisms had been made of Veritasium."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 34760,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For example, when Destin and I performed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 37040,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "our experiments to show that the water swirls"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 39220,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the opposite way in the northern and southern hemispheres,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 41920,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we only showed doing it once"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 43800,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even though we each did it three or four times in our own hemisphere."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 47520,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I guess that brings forth the question"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 49420,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "should we change what we're doing --"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 51540,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean should Mythbusters and Veritasium"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 53620,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "really show the repetitive nature of science"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 55980,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and use statistical results as evidence for our claims."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 60400,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well my answer is no, but to understand why"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 64220,
    "dDurationMs": 2060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we first have to dig into something called"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 66280,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the helping experiment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 67600,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this was performed in New York"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 69360,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the 1960s. And the way it went was --"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 72300,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "individual participants were placed in isolated booths"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 76100,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where they could speak to five other participants through an intercom"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 79480,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but only one mic was live at a time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82180,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And these participants were meant to speak in turns"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 84900,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for two minutes each about their lives --"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 87420,
    "dDurationMs": 1540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "any problems they were having --"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 88960,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it would just go in rounds."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 91380,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now what the participants didn't know was that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 93480,
    "dDurationMs": 1580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "one of them was actually an actor"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 95060,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "who was reading a script"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 96440,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "prepared for him by the experimenters."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 98960,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And he went first in the first round."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 100800,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He talked about the problems he was having adjusting to life in New York City"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 104300,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and particularly the difficulty that he gets the seizures, particularly when stressed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 108700,
    "dDurationMs": 3340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so everyone else had their turn and then it came back 'round"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 112040,
    "dDurationMs": 1940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to this actor again. Now this time"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 113980,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when he was speaking he became more and more incoherent as he"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 117400,
    "dDurationMs": 5300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was talking. He said that he could feel a seizure coming on and he made choking noises,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 122700,
    "dDurationMs": 2620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he asked for help from the other participants --"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 125320,
    "dDurationMs": 2140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he said he felt like he was dying --"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 127460,
    "dDurationMs": 2620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and, uh, then he continued to get more and more distressed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 130080,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "until his mic went off."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 133320,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the point of the experiment was to see how many of the participants would help."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 138160,
    "dDurationMs": 3460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, if you were one of the other participants, do you think you would've left your booth"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 141620,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and gone to see if he was okay?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 143940,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In total, about 13 participants took part in this experiment --"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 148120,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the number that helped before his mic was turned off --"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 151400,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was just four."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 153660,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, while this might sound a little bit disappointing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 156220,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about the state of human helpfulness,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 158400,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you gotta keep in mind that there were other people listening to the same distress call"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 161720,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that may have diffused the responsibility that individuals would feel;"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 166020,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this is something known as the \"bystander effect.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 168800,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, what's interesting about this experiment from my point of view"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 171300,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is not how it confirms the bystander effect,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 173720,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but in how people view the results."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176240,
    "dDurationMs": 3020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For example, they fail to change their opinion"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 179260,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of themselves or others after learning about this experiment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 182440,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For example, have you changed your opinion"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 184940,
    "dDurationMs": 2980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about how likely you would be to help in this situation --"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 188340,
    "dDurationMs": 3860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "now that you know that only 30 percent of people did, in that situation?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 193180,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, there was a follow-up study conducted"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 195300,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where students were shown two videos"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 197980,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of individual participants who were purported to be from the original study."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 202380,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And they had already learned about the study,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 204180,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then they were asked at the end of watching those two videos --"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 206380,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which were pretty uninformative, just showed that these people were"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 208800,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "good, decent, ordinary people --"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 210540,
    "dDurationMs": 1700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "these students were asked,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 212240,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"How likely do you think it was"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 214080,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that those two particular participants helped?\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 216500,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And overwhelmingly students felt"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 219080,
    "dDurationMs": 2540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that those two participants would have helped --"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 221620,
    "dDurationMs": 3620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even though they knew that, statistically, only 30 percent did, so,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 225240,
    "dDurationMs": 3380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in fact, if would've been a better guess to say that they probably didn't."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 228620,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They didn't seem to really internalize"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 230880,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "those general results as pertaining to the particular,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 234080,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they kind of assumed it excluded"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 236360,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ordinary, good, decent people."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 239340,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, is there a way to get people to really"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 242060,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "understand how the world works?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 244440,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, they did another follow-up study"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 246400,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where they talked about the experiment,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 248600,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they described the experiment,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 249860,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but they didn't give the results."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 251480,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then they showed those two participant videos --"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 254260,
    "dDurationMs": 2740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "again, not mentioning anything about the experiment,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 257000,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just showing that these are two, decent, ordinary people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 260600,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then they told the students that those two people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 262860,
    "dDurationMs": 1820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "did not help in the experiment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 264680,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And they asked the students to, uh, guess"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 267160,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what proportion of people did help."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 269980,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And now, in this case, when they were going"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 271740,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from those particular examples of ordinary, nice people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 274420,
    "dDurationMs": 1180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "who didn't help,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 275600,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they were much better at generalizing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 278060,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the overall result,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 280020,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the statistical result."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 282100,
    "dDurationMs": 1940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In fact, they got it basically right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 285060,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I think this highlights for us that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 287620,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "our brains are much better at"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 289720,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "working with individual stories"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 292040,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and things in detail"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 294360,
    "dDurationMs": 2380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than they are with statistical results."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 297720,
    "dDurationMs": 1700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that is why I think"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 299420,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if you're Mythbusters or Veritasium"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 301420,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's better to communicate science --"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 303820,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to tell the story,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 305320,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to show the experiment, really, once in a dramatic way --"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 308120,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "rather than three or four times"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 310220,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where each new iteration --"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 311860,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "well, each repetition --"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 313180,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just confirms the original result that you were talking about."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 316120,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if you're actually doing the science."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 318120,
    "dDurationMs": 2140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you're actually trying to establish scientific fact --"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 320260,
    "dDurationMs": 980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then of course"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 321240,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you need the repetition and the statistical analysis."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 324800,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I think it really does come down to what your objectives are."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 328340,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But with this conclusion"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 330340,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think this opens up"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 332200,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "two big potential pitfalls."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 335100,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One is that people without scientific evidence"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 337500,
    "dDurationMs": 1700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "can make crafty stories"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 339200,
    "dDurationMs": 820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that catch on"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 340020,
    "dDurationMs": 3460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and quickly become what people feel is the truth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 343480,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the other pitfall is scientists"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 345480,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Who have strong scientific evidence --"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 347680,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Who have clear statistical results --"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 350040,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and yet they can't communicate them to people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 352040,
    "dDurationMs": 3020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because they don't have a great story."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 355060,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, an example of the first pitfall"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 357060,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is the recent spread of this rumor"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 359060,
    "dDurationMs": 5080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That the outbreak of a birth defect microsephaly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 364140,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in South America was actually caused"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 366480,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by a larvicide made by Monsanto."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 369060,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That story caught on like wildfire."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 371900,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you can see why because its got this clear villain --"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 374720,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that everyone loves to hate -- in Monsanto."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 376720,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And its got a really causal story"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 379480,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That someone is doing something bad"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 381940,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the water -- and its this poison"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 383800,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that were poisoning ourselves and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 385080,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "its a very emotive -- clear -- story."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 387360,
    "dDurationMs": 2620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "While the other story is, uh,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 389980,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well it's a little bit more statistical -- that there is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 392320,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "some kind of connection -- which is the scientific consensus"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 394840,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That the Zika virus carried by"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 396840,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "these, uh, mosquitoes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 398700,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is causing the microsephaly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 400380,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And there are strong indications that that really is what's happening."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 404520,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if you look at the claims about the larvicide,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 406280,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they really don't hold much weight."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 408480,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, the larvicide is so weak,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 411000,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that you could drink a thousand litres of it a day."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 414160,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A thousand litres of the water treated with this larvicide and have no adverse effects."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 419040,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Or, uh, this larvicide has been used in dog and cat pet collars."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 423340,
    "dDurationMs": 6080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Um, so really, you know, there isn't strong evidence for the larvicide connection. In fact"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 429420,
    "dDurationMs": 3940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There is no connection between the larvicide and Monsanto at all."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 434000,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I think the story took hold because it had such a strong narrative"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 439520,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On the other hand, you have things like climate change,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 443120,
    "dDurationMs": 4580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which have very strong statistical evidence to back them up,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 447700,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "large scale result over the globe."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 449920,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And yet, one cold snowy winter is so much more, uh,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 454560,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "visceral and meaningful to individual people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 457200,
    "dDurationMs": 4060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than this thing which feels, you know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 461260,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "completely databased."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 465920,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And, it just depends on how much you trust data, I guess."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 469260,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As scientists, we love data."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 471100,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we feel like, if we're trying to communicate to someone,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 474760,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we're trying to convince someone of something,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 477000,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all we have to do is show more data."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 480560,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But what experiments demonstrate to us with statistical certainty"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 484460,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is that stories work much better."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 498000,
    "dDurationMs": 5060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Normally I do this walk and talk self videos on my second channel, 2Veritasium, but"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 503060,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I imagine that some of you might not know that that exists."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 506100,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, I thought I'd put one of these here on 1Veritasium."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 508520,
    "dDurationMs": 5080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Plus, this one has a fair amount of data and, you know, experimental stuff in it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 513600,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so I figured that could be interesting for you as well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 516300,
    "dDurationMs": 1420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if you want to check out the check..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 517720,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[CHUCKLES]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 519120,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if you want to check out the second channel, then"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 520980,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "go to 2Veritasium. I'll put a card or something for it up here."
    } ]
  } ]
}
